MISSION BRIEF -- ACTIVE
Rank: B | Authorizing office: Kazekage Office, Wind Division

Objective: Escort and secure a contracted hardwood caravan from the northern
oasis mills to Sunagakure, protecting the timber consignment reserved for
Puppet Workshop reconstruction.

Assigned team: One chunin squad leader, three genin. Wind-nature user attached
for sandstorm dispersal.

Threat assessment: Moderate. Desert raiders have struck two prior convoys this
cycle; a rival smuggling ring is suspected. No enemy-village activity reported
on the route.

Standing orders:
- Travel by night; hole up at midday shade points.
- Maintain water discipline per ration policy.
- On contact with raiders, secure the cargo first, pursue second.
- Report arrival to the Quartermaster and any losses to this office within one
  cycle of return.

Duration: Estimated four days round trip, weather permitting. Filed active.
